<h3 id="registering-an-nsurlprotocol-subclass">Registering an NSURLProtocol Subclass</h3>

<p>Register this subclass at an appropriate location. For network requests based on NSURLConnection or created using <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">[NSURLSession sharedSession]</code>, simply call the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">registerClass</code> method.</p>

